Core Concept


Speed tells you how much distance is covered per unit time. 
That's it — everything else in this topic is just this one relationship applied in different situations 
(trains, boats, races, clocks)

1] Speed = Distance / Time

Whenever you're stuck on a problem, come back to this triangle — cover whichever variable you want to find, 
and the relationship between the other two tells you the formula.
